# Events pre-implementation verify — before any code

**Todo (scores + failure points):** [`tasks/events/todo.md`](../../../tasks/events/todo.md) § Per-task verify pack  
**Enforcement:** [`mdeai-events-task-skill-mcp-gate.mdc`](./mdeai-events-task-skill-mcp-gate.mdc) (alwaysApply)  
**Skills index:** [`index-skills.md`](../../../index-skills.md) § Events Platform

## Hard rule

**Do not write implementation code** for an Events task until pre-verify completes and `todo.md` is updated with readiness + failure points for that row.

---

## Pre-verify protocol (run in order)

| Step | Action | Tool |
|------|--------|------|
| 1 | Read full task row in `todo.md` + Linear issue body | Linear MCP `get_issue` + `includeRelations: true` |
| 2 | Confirm blockers cleared | Linear `blockedBy`; gate audit if Phase B |
| 3 | Load ≤5 routed skills | [`mdeai-skills-best-practices.mdc`](./mdeai-skills-best-practices.mdc) |
| 4 | **MCP before external APIs** | Supabase schema · CopilotKit · Gemini · Maps — per touch surface |
| 5 | Disk probes | `task-verifier` — paths, deps, RLS, enums, agent names |
| 6 | Score **readiness** (0–100) | Rubric below |
| 7 | Estimate **success rate** (0–100) | First-pass merge probability |
| 8 | List **failure points** | Errors, blockers, scope creep, test gaps |
| 9 | Update `todo.md` row | Readiness + success rate + failure points column |
| 10 | **Stop** if readiness &lt; 70 or any 🔴 blocker | Report to user; do not implement |

---

## Readiness rubric (pre-implementation, 100 pts)

| Dimension | Weight | Probe |
|-----------|-------:|-------|
| Spec / AC on disk | 25 | Linear body + `tasks/events/**` spec exists and matches scope |
| Blockers / deps | 25 | Linear relations; gate audit if venue chain |
| Skills + MCP match | 25 | Correct skill pack; MCP confirms APIs/schema/models |
| Test plan | 15 | Playwright/Vitest path named; evidence template ready |
| Process | 10 | Full SAN title; one PR; branch name; no scope creep |

```text
readiness = round(0.25×spec + 0.25×blockers + 0.25×mcp + 0.15×tests + 0.10×process)
```

| Readiness | Meaning |
|----------:|---------|
| 90–100 | Safe to implement |
| 70–89 | Proceed with listed mitigations |
| &lt;70 | **Do not implement** — fix spec/blockers first |

---

## Success rate (pre vs post)

| Phase | Definition |
|-------|------------|
| **Pre-implementation** | Estimated probability of clean first merge (readiness minus penalty per 🔴 failure point: −10 each, 🟡 −5, cap 0) |
| **Post-shipment** | Equals **% correct** from [`changelog.md`](../../../tasks/events/changelog.md) execution formula |

After merge: replace pre-impl success rate with post-ship **Grade** + **% correct** in `todo.md`.

---

## Failure points (required in todo.md)

For each task, document before coding:

```markdown
**Failure points:** 🔴 blocker · 🟡 risk · 🟢 mitigated
- 🔴 …
- 🟡 …
```

Categories to check:

- Linear `blockedBy` not cleared
- Missing spec / wireframe / migration plan
- MCP contradicts skill (wrong model, schema drift)
- Scope overlap with adjacent PR (e.g. SAN-731 vs SAN-135)
- No test spec; prod env gap
- RLS / service-role / CopilotKit agent-name traps

---

## Required pre-impl output (chat or comment)

```markdown
## Pre-verify — SAN-### · SPEC-ID — title

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Readiness | NN/100 |
| Success rate (est.) | NN% |
| Grade / % correct | — (pre-ship) |

**Skills loaded:** …
**MCP probes:** …

**Failure points:**
- 🔴 …
- 🟡 …

**Verdict:** GO / HOLD
```

**GO** only if readiness ≥ 70 and no unresolved 🔴 blockers.

